    const T1 = `[00:05] Rohan Mehta: Thanks for joining. Shree Fasteners delivered eleven of twelve orders on time last quarter, and the one late order was held at their end for a missing test certificate.\n[00:41] Asha Verma: On payments, two invoices are on hold because the invoice total did not match the purchase order. Finance cannot release them until the supplier sends corrected copies.\n[01:20] Neha Iyer: We agreed to keep them as an approved vendor for the next year, given the delivery record.\n[01:52] Rohan Mehta: Asha will send the two invoice numbers to the supplier by Friday.\n[02:10] Asha Verma: I will share the payment schedule once the corrected invoices arrive.\n[02:34] Neha Iyer: Rohan needs to raise the purchase order for the next four thousand bolts by tomorrow.\n[02:58] Rohan Mehta: Someone from quality will check the test certificate process with their plant.
[03:10] Vikas Rao: I will send the revised test certificates once our lab signs them.`;
    const T2 = `[00:03] Neha Iyer: Three offers went out last week for the procurement analyst role and two were accepted.\n[00:30] Asha Verma: The third candidate asked for a later joining date, which pushes our month-end close support by two weeks.\n[01:02] Neha Iyer: We decided to hold the third offer open until Monday and then move to the next person on the shortlist.\n[01:25] Neha Iyer: I will call the candidate by Monday.\n[01:40] Asha Verma: I will draft the onboarding plan for the two joiners by end of week.`;
